  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith (Site plan received 28.01.11 and Drawing 2011/15/1 Rev 2 received 05.05.11) and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The residential accommodation shall be for staff working at the nursery only.",
    "Condition : 4 - The parking layout, as shown on drawing No. 2011/15/1 Rev 2 shall be constructed prior to the occupation of the property for use as a nursery and shall be retained as such for the period of operation.",
    "Condition : 5 - The site shall be used as a children's nursery with ancillary office space and with ancillary first floor residential accommodation and for no other purpose (including any other purpose in Class D1 of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987, or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any statutory instrument revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification).",
    "Condition : 6 - The use hereby permitted for nursery purposes shall not be carried on outside the hours of 8am to 6pm, Monday to Friday.",
    "Condition : 7 - The use hereby permitted shall not commence until crash barriers have been erected on the northern boundary wall adjacent to the play area.",
    "Condition : 8 - The play area to the west of the main building shall include landscaping around the eastern and southern boundaries."
  ],
